sequenceDiagram
  participant EM as Email integration
  participant T as enable_waiting task
  participant W as HogFlow writes
  participant IU as Integration usage
  participant PH as Analytics
  Note over EM: verify button or sweep
  EM->>EM: write verified = true
  EM->>T: on commit: dispatch(team, sender_ids)
  T->>IU: waiting_flows_for(sender_ids)
  IU-->>T: waiting flows
  loop each waiting flow
    T->>W: enable(flow, actor = enable_requested_by)
    W->>W: lock row, still waiting?
    W->>IU: senders_of(flow)
    alt all verified now
      W->>W: save active, went_live_at = now
      W->>PH: hog_flow_activated {activated_by: domain_verified, seconds_waiting}
      Note over W: post_save reloads Node, which runs the flow
    else another sender still unverified
      W->>W: stays waiting, no event
    end
  end
